# Versioned scrontab for the device-monitoring cron (rtgs-lab-tools), run from Bryan's MSI
# account out of the lab's shared workspace. A change here is a PR; it reaches MSI when
# re-installed:  scrontab <this file>   (replaces the account's whole scrontab -- merge by hand
# if it holds other jobs). scripts/scheduled_device_monitoring.sh may be a stale copy: the
# script re-runs the pinned release's own copy when they differ.
# --time must exceed the script's retry budget (3 x 600 s + 2 x 120 s = 34 min).
#SCRON --time=01:00:00
#SCRON --job-name=devmon-publish
27 4 * * 1-5 /projects/standard/runck014/shared/device_monitoring/scripts/scheduled_device_monitoring.sh
